WEBVTT

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.976
Na nilipoanza kuandika,
nikiwa na takriban miaka saba,

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.048
hadithi za penseli na michoro ya rangi

00:00:36.072 --> 00:00:39.604
ambazo mama yangu alilazimika kuzisoma,

00:00:39.628 --> 00:00:43.196
niliandika hadithi
sawa na zile nilizokuwa nazisoma:

00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:47.976
Wahusika wangu wote 
walikuwa wazungu na wenye macho ya bluu.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.307
Walicheza katika theluji.

00:00:50.331 --> 00:00:52.418
Walikula matofaa

00:00:52.442 --> 00:00:53.839
(Kicheko)

00:00:54.013 --> 00:00:56.024
Na walizungumza sana kuhusu hali ya hewa,

00:00:56.048 --> 00:00:58.176
jinsi ilivyo vizuri kuona jua limechomoza.

00:00:58.409 --> 00:01:00.373
(Kicheko)